[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727135317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114777#issuecomment-3727135317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114777","id":3727135317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eJ5JV","user":{"login":"SuperTemich2005","id":39464061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDY0MDYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39464061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005","html_url":"https://github.com/SuperTemich2005","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T04:22:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T04:22:24Z","body":"I believe I know what's going on. The VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D node does not respect culling by control elements. If you move right-side panel up so that it touches the screen, as you scroll down, the VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D nodes will actually leave the screen. The way they are right now, they do get culled by the borders of the ScrollContainer but don't actually leave the screen.\n\nInterestingly enough, sprites parented to Control nodes do get visually culled, which means that there might be a solution.\n\n<img width=\"504\" height=\"586\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a019b858-c828-4955-92e3-bbf978927d40\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727135317/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727146877","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114777#issuecomment-3727146877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114777","id":3727146877,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eJ799","user":{"login":"SuperTemich2005","id":39464061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDY0MDYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39464061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005","html_url":"https://github.com/SuperTemich2005","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T04:29:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T04:29:37Z","body":"<img width=\"398\" height=\"807\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a63c79e-3738-4cfa-b09a-d368f01b5699\" /> To better illustrate what's going on, I used a RemoteTransform2D to show the VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D's true location on screen. Note how it's not actually out of screen, which is why screen_exited() doesn't fire.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727146877/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727327174","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114777#issuecomment-3727327174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114777","id":3727327174,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eKn_G","user":{"login":"SuperTemich2005","id":39464061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDY0MDYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39464061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005","html_url":"https://github.com/SuperTemich2005","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperTemich2005/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T05:58:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T05:58:40Z","body":"So, personally, I've come to a conclusion that **this is not a bug.** VisibileOnScreenNotifier2D node extends Node2D, clipping is done by ScrollContainer node which extends Control. Two have significantly different workflows, modifying VOSN requires modifying an internal method called `_attach_canvas_item_for_draw` in class `RendererCanvasCull`, which is called for all Node2D nodes, and modification in question would be checking for overlaps not only between Node2D's bounding box and viewport, but Node2D's bounding box with viewport _and_ every relevant Control.\n\nWhat I propose instead is a VisibleOnScreenNotifier node that extends Control and is processed in Control workflow, which is what I intend to work on right now. But I suggest that meanwhile, you take a game design approach to this problem.\n\nI'm not a core contributor, so closing topics is not up to me, but I made my point.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727327174/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3728093354","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114777#issuecomment-3728093354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114777","id":3728093354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eNjCq","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T09:37:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T09:42:42Z","body":"`Control`'s `clip_contens` finally also calls a method in class `RendererCanvasCull`, which is `_cull_canvas_item`.\n\nNode2d and Control both use `RendererCanvasCull` to achieve their clipping function, so I think there is a chance to make the VisibleOnScreenNotifier2D work both on Node2D and Control.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3728093354/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]